    "updated_at": "2026-11-24T14:52:32Z",
    "body": "Demand data point (counts only): a third-party library converter (Dutchman 0.3.1-rc.7) drops **96 tapered mills with a flat or ball tip** from a real vendor library, because CamCraft's taper ends in a sharp point and `.camtools` cannot store a tip form (see #3662). With the tip form here plus its `.camtools` field, they would convert. No library content used. Note: qsmits's Tool library dialog series (#3663, #3892-#3898, PR #3900) touches the tool editor; worth lining up so the tip-form fields land in the new dialog.",
