    "body": "fix on issue/3368-taper-tip-form · PR #3929 · pinned by taper::tests, meridian::tests::a_sharp_taper_keeps_its_profile_and_digest, tool_law::every_operation_refuses_a_non_sharp_taper_by_name, mcp_deburr::a_deburr_refuses_its_tool_after_a_flat_tip_edit, tool_library::a_tip_form_round_trips_and_steps_the_version, project_roundtrip::a_tip_form_round_trips_and_steps_the_project_version, mcp_edit_tool::edit_tool_sets_the_tip_form, tool_library_editor::the_tip_form_row_shows_for_a_taper · merges at the next cut\n\nThe PR steps the `.camproj` version (to 79) only for a file with a flat or ball tip, as our comment above proposes. The step is isolated in `project/file.rs`, and the PR body says how to remove it. A collaborator can replace `claimed` with `in-review`, please. This account cannot set labels.",
